{"description":"This project uses quantum dots as advanced optical sensors within an interactive 3D dashboard. It simulates how these nanoscale particles detect atmospheric gases on distant planets by mapping their size-dependent bandgaps to shifting light frequencies, effectively turning nanoscale physics into a tool for macro-scale space exploration.","image":null,"members":[{"name":"Abid Ali Leghari","country":"Pakistan","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/1000131718.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":true},{"name":"Samreen Lund","country":"Pakistan","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/IMG-20251223-WA0044.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"Gulfaraz Ahmed","country":"Pakistan","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/1000172990.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"Niaz Hussain","country":"Pakistan","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/1000023324.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.png","owner":false},{"name":"Antisha Zehra","country":"Pakistan","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/1000218411_dtHIxSm.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.png","owner":false},{"name":"Iqra bhatti","country":"Pakistan","avatar":null,"owner":false}]}